        "a11y": "A real table with a caption, aria-rowcount and aria-busy. Sortable headers hold a button and carry aria-sort. The scrolling frame is a labelled focusable region so the keyboard can scroll it. Checkboxes name their row; the selection count is a polite status. The card layout keeps the header for assistive technology. Cell values are set as text, never parsed as HTML.",
        "blazor": {
            "component": "DataGrid",
            "existing": true,
            "params": [
                {
                    "name": "Columns",
                    "prop": "columns",
                    "type": "IReadOnlyList<DataGridColumn>"
                },
                {
                    "name": "Items",
                    "prop": "rows",
                    "type": "IReadOnlyList<TItem>"
                },
                {
                    "name": "EnableSelection",
                    "prop": "selectable",
                    "type": "bool"
                },
                {
                    "name": "SelectedKeys",
                    "prop": "selected",
                    "type": "HashSet<int>"
                },
                {
                    "name": "PhoneLayout",
                    "prop": "cards",
                    "type": "DataGridPhoneLayout"
                },
                {
                    "name": "Loading",
                    "prop": "loading",
                    "type": "bool"
                },
                {
                    "name": "HeaderActionsTemplate",
                    "slot": "toolbar",
                    "type": "RenderFragment"
                },
                {
                    "name": "FilterTemplate",
                    "slot": "toolbar",
                    "type": "RenderFragment"
                },
                {
                    "name": "FooterTemplate",
                    "slot": "footer",
                    "type": "RenderFragment"
                },
                {
                    "name": "BulkTemplate",
                    "slot": "bulk",
                    "type": "RenderFragment"
                },
                {
                    "name": "RowTemplate",
                    "slot": "cell-<rowId>-<key>",
                    "type": "RenderFragment<TItem>"
                },
                {
                    "name": "OnRowClick",
                    "event": "pk-row-click",
                    "type": "EventCallback<TItem>"
                },
                {
                    "name": "OnSelectionChanged",
                    "event": "pk-select",
                    "type": "EventCallback"
                },
                {
                    "name": "OnSort",
                    "event": "pk-sort",
                    "type": "EventCallback<SortEventArgs>"
                },
                {
                    "name": "OnFilter",
                    "event": "pk-filter",
                    "type": "EventCallback<FilterEventArgs>"
                }
            ],
            "notes": "The Blazor DataGrid keeps owning the data source. It calls DataSource(DataGridRequest), then sets rows (DataGridPage.Items), and turns pk-sort, pk-filter and pk-pagination's pk-page and pk-page-size into the next DataGridRequest (SortColumn, Descending, ColumnFilters, Page, PageSize). It renders the element with manual set. RowTemplate cells become slots named cell-<rowId>-<key> (RenderFragment<TItem> per cell); DataGridColumn(Key, Header, Sortable, NumericAlign) maps to { key, label, sortable, align: end }. The simple slot-based DataTable component maps to the same element without manual. Hidden columns are simply left out of columns. The Blazor EmptyText fills the empty slot."
        },
        "examples": [
            {
                "title": "Sortable, selectable table",
                "html": "<pk-table id=\"t1\" label=\"Products\" caption=\"Stock by product\" striped hover selectable\n  columns='[{\"key\":\"sku\",\"label\":\"SKU\",\"sortable\":true},{\"key\":\"price\",\"label\":\"Price\",\"type\":\"number\",\"sortable\":true}]'\n  rows='[{\"id\":1,\"sku\":\"AC-001\",\"price\":\"$4.99\"},{\"id\":2,\"sku\":\"AC-002\",\"price\":\"$3.99\"}]'>\n  <pk-button slot=\"bulk\" size=\"mini\" variant=\"ghost\">Archive</pk-button>\n</pk-table>"
            },
            {
                "title": "Empty and loading",
                "html": "<pk-table label=\"Empty\" columns='[{\"key\":\"sku\",\"label\":\"SKU\"}]' empty-text=\"No products yet\"></pk-table>\n<pk-table label=\"Loading\" loading columns='[{\"key\":\"sku\",\"label\":\"SKU\"}]'></pk-table>"
            },
            {
                "title": "Expandable rows",
                "html": "<pk-table label=\"POs\" expandable columns='[{\"key\":\"po\",\"label\":\"PO\"}]' rows='[{\"id\":1,\"po\":\"PO 1042\"}]'>\n  <p slot=\"detail-1\">3 lines: Widget 1 x 20.</p>\n</pk-table>"
            }
        ],
